    "updated_at": "2016-06-22T02:21:38Z",
    "body": "The [entries-api](https://wicg.github.io/entries-api/) attempts to specify the directory upload types and behavior as already implemented and shipping in Chrome, and apparently coming soon in Edge as well per @aliams, to ease interoperable implementations. As noted in the [Explainer](https://github.com/WICG/entries-api/blob/gh-pages/EXPLAINER.md), \"it is also very explicitly not a goal of this document to preclude further exploration of this area with APIs by other specifications that may improve the usability of this functionality\"\n\nI don't know what any other browser vendors' plans are, but I'd venture it's a tad early to merge anything into HTML in this space until we've got more clarity, though.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
